{
  "name": "Expand your best customers into lookalike companies and their decision makers with Apify and Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 760,
        "content": "## Expand your best customers into lookalike accounts\n\n### Who's it for\nFounders and sales teams who know their ten best customers and want the next hundred: companies in the same industry, country and size band, with the people to contact at each.\n\n### How it works\n1. A Code node holds the seed domains (your best customers).\n2. **Lookalike Company Finder** (`b2bsearch/lookalike-company-finder`) returns similar companies for each seed with an explicit `matchedOn` string (industry, country, size): no black-box score.\n3. The lookalike domains go to **Decision Maker Finder by Domain** for founders, C-level and VPs.\n4. One row per person lands in your Google Sheet with the company it was found at and the seed it came from.\n\n### Setup steps\n- Add your Apify credential to both Apify nodes.\n- Edit the seed domains in **Seed customers**.\n- Pick the output sheet in **Append accounts and people**.\n- Optional: `maxPerSeed`, `sameCountry`, `sameSize`, `countries` in the first Apify node; `roles` and `maxPerCompany` in the second.\n\n### Requirements\n- Apify account. Lookalikes cost $0.0015 per company ($1.50 per 1,000); decision makers $0.0032 per person. Ten seeds at 25 lookalikes and 3 people each: about $0.38 + $1.20.\n- Google Sheets credential.\n\n### Disclosure\nThe Apify Actor in this template is built by the author of the template. It is pay per result: a miss is a free row."
      },
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -900,
        -220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 420,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "## 1. Seeds\nTen distinct customer domains work best; two similar seeds can return the same company twice.",
        "color": 7
      },
      "name": "Note: seeds",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -380,
        -220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
